      "doc": "prev=0 at t=0, cur=3000 at t=3s: delta=3000 over dt=3s -> 1000/s. The delta is NOT attributed to a single nominal bucket (that would be 3000/s), and two nominal samples were missed: floor(3s/1s)-1 = 2.",
